*    This include file contains all the epics extracted variables, 
*    which should be parsed to the engine for further use.
* $Log: gen_epics.cmn
*
* Revision 2.0 Mar 1, 2000 Jinghua
* (JLiu) Added the BCMs and removed all unnecessary variables.
*
* Revision 1.5 February 23, 2000, Paul Gueye
*	1. Update file to match new changes in g_extract_beam_info.f
*	   (original code: g_extract_bpm.f)
*	2. Include new variables:
*        - Magnets: NMR reading, temperature sensors
*        - OTR: beam position, widths, calibration
*        - Fast feedback information
*
* Revision 1.1  Jan. 24, 1997, Joerg Reinhold
* Initial revision
*
*
*     CTPTYPE=event
*

